<NavigationBreadcrumbs>btnConfigure\0btnAdvanced</NavigationBreadcrumbs>
<DescriptionTexts>Configure now to set up your USB device for Xbox 360 storage. Everything on the device will be removed, and all of its space, up to 16 GB, will be reserved for Xbox 360 storage.

Devices used for Xbox 360 storage must be at least 1 GB.\0Customize your device to choose how much space to use for Xbox 360 storage. 

To customize, the device needs at least 768 MB free.</DescriptionTexts>
